      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but my doctor is super busy and it takes weeks to get an appointment. i just need some relief so i can sleep tonight. how \"dangerous\" are we talking? i mean, they're both just for mood/pain, right? it's just one or two pills, surely that isn't gonna do anything major?",
